  10,
  'Master Cloud Computing Basics fundamentals with quick reading and 15 practice MCQs on FEEDX.',
  '### Overview of Cloud Computing Basics

Cloud Computing Basics is an essential concept in modern technology and engineering education. Understanding its core components enables effective problem-solving and application development.

### Key Takeaways
- Key Concept 1: Core definition and significance of Cloud Computing Basics.
- Key Concept 2: Practical implementation and best practices.
- Key Concept 3: Industry standards and application workflows.',
  TRUE
) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title;

